# Line endings for anything the LINUX IMAGE runs.
#
# GB is built from `git archive HEAD ghost-browser` on a Windows checkout, and git archive applies
# the worktree eol conversion — so entrypoint.sh left the repo with CRLF even though the blob is LF.
# A shebang ending in \r is not a path: the v195 pod crashlooped with
#   exec /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory
# and the browser was down until v196. These files are LF wherever they are checked out or exported.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
